<title>AUSTRIA: Kaestle skis slide further downhill.</title>
<headline>Kaestle skis slide further downhill.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian ski manufacturer Kaestle, part of Italy's Benetton group since 1989, on Monday reported a set of 1996 business results snowed under by deepening losses.</p>
<p>Kaestle's pretax loss widened to 53.6 million schillings from a loss of 3.6 million the year before, although sales increased 12.7 percent to 629.6 million schillings. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
